  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-3731"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that libssh incorrectly performed bounds checking when\nprocessing SFTP extensions. If a client application queried extension data out\nof bounds, it could cause the application to crash, resulting in a denial of\nservice, or exhibit unintended behavior.",
